{"synopsis":"He Qingyang menemukan dirinya terjebak dalam permainan yang sering ia mainkan, “Swordman Immortal fate” menjadi seorang NPC malang yang ceritanya selalu ia lewati. NPC ini terus-menerus mengganggu protagonis wanita utama, Ning Yiwan, dan akhirnya terbunuh olehnya ketika identitasnya terbongkar. Untuk mengubah nasib NPC ini, He Qingyang berencana menyelesaikan tiga misi tingkat bumi dengan cepat dan kemudian melarikan diri. Namun, yang tak disangka, nasibnya ternyata terikat erat dengan Ning Yiwan…","alternative_title":"穿越成倒霉NPC: 我有老婆罩着, Reincarnated as an Unlucky NPC: My Wife's Got My Back","author":"英之耀","artist":"英之耀","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c5c46f76-3b49-4970-9ed7-f7517f22ae10","number":"127","chapter":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2025-08-27","released":"2025-08-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6d1e2b97-8150-4c15-bcd6-56728ce7bb0e","number":"126","chapter":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2025-08-27","released":"2025-08-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"66225a83-803c-4154-b41b-91cb7cde6561","number":"125","chapter":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2025-08-01","released":"2025-08-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"79efb069-b067-4547-8f04-813ea42d2cfa","number":"124","chapter":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2025-07-29","released":"2025-07-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c0b51804-e200-412c-aaa4-708be4304b9a","number":"123","chapter":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2025-07-09","released":"2025-07-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"898e7bb9-9849-4d03-b45c-3ece4265a109","number":"122","chapter":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2025-07-09","released":"2025-07-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d7fef85f-0574-4610-a870-260cf4de9f4d","number":"121","chapter":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2025-06-25","released":"2025-06-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"583b9a2d-f4ef-4d6c-9073-5f32c361bfab","number":"120","chapter":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2025-06-25","released":"2025-06-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0eb6a67b-0344-4a12-bbdd-7091